# Task prompts

Paste one at a time into Claude Code, or as a GitHub issue comment starting with
`@claude` once `.github/workflows/claude.yml` is merged. One task per prompt —
batching them produces diffs too large to review on a phone.

---

## 0. Install this bundle

```
Add the backend infrastructure bundle to this repo exactly as provided: .claude/,
.github/, netlify/functions/, scripts/, supabase/, ops/, CLAUDE.md, package.json,
.env.example. Do not modify the files. Then run `npm install` and `npm run guards`,
report which guards fail and why, and open a PR titled "Backend infrastructure and
CI guards". Do not push to main.
```

